# Teak

Fit a large directory tree into a fixed line budget.

## Install

```sh
cargo install teak
```

## Usage

- `teak` shows the current directory.
- `teak -n 40 src/` fits `src/` into 40 lines.
- `teak --mismatches` lists files whose content does not match the extension.

See [the docs](docs/README.md) for more.
